<ptxt>Inspect Navigation Antenna Cord</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Navigation Antenna Cord Installation Condition Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Inspect the navigation antenna cord for installation problems such as sharp bends or pinching.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Installation normal</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Measurement</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector shown in the illustration that is connected to the navigation receiver assembly.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E101260J07" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the navigation antenna cord between the navigation antenna assembly and navigation receiver assembly.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
